## Summary
n8n is a fair-code workflow automation platform with native AI capabilities. It allows users to build workflows visually or with custom code, and supports self-hosting or cloud deployment, featuring over 400 integrations.

## Key Points
- Native AI capabilities integrated into the workflow automation platform
- Flexible workflow building using both visual interfaces and custom code
- Deployment options include self-hosting and cloud-based usage
- Extensive integration support with over 400 connectors available
- Fair-code licensing model promoting ethical software development


